                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Davida wakati, O Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli, swiililisya ndime ndemulanda wako, nkaambo Saulo ulayanda kuza ku-Kcila kuzoomwaya munzi nkaambo kandime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sa bantu ba-Kcila balandaaba mumaanza aakwe? Sa Saulo uleza mbubonya mbuli mbemvwide ndemulanda wako? O Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli, kondilwiida ndemulanda wako. Nkabela Jehova wakati, Uleza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Davida wakabuzya kuti, Sa bantu ba-Kcila balandaaba, mebo abantu bangu, mumaanza aa-Saulo? Nkabela Jehova wakati, Balamwaaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
