              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bantu ba-Zifi bakainka kuli-Saulo ku-Gibeya, bakati, Sa Davida tayubide kulindiswe mumampangala aamucisaka na? Sa tali kucilundu ca-Hakila cili kululyo lyagundu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino, O mwami, boola mbuli moyo wako mbuusukeme kuboola, nkabela iswe tuyoomwaaba mumaanza aamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Saulo wakati, Jehova amulongezye, mbuli mbumwandifwida insoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamuya lino, kamuciya businizya, mukazibe mweenya wakwe nkuubede nkwayubide. Nguni uumubwene? Ndaambilwa kuti ngusimaanu loko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukalange, mukazibe ziyubilo zyakwe zyoonse nzyayubila, elyo mwaakuzizibisya mukaboole kulindime, nkabela nzooinke anywe. Na nkwali, nzoomujana ndazoomuyandaula akati kazyuulu zyoonse zya-Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
