        {
          "text": "Lino Saulo wakainda kumwi kubbazu lyacilundu, alakwe Davida abantu bakwe bakainda kumwi kubbazu lyacilundu, aboobo Davida wakalibindeene kucija Saulo. Nkabela Saulo abantu bakwe bakazinga Davida abantu bakwe kuti babajate. ",
